      "title": "Suraj Estate Developers Limited (NSEI:SURAJEST) completed the acquisition of Hally Pacific Private Limited.",
      "body": "Suraj Estate Developers Limited (NSEI:SURAJEST) entered into agreement to acquire Hally Pacific Private Limited for approximately INR 300 million on February 20, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 304 million valued at INR 60800 per share will be paid by Suraj Estate Developers Limited. As part of consideration, INR 304 million is paid towards common equity of Hally Pacific Private Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Hally Pacific Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 1.74 million.\n\nSuraj Estate Developers Limited (NSEI:SURAJEST) completed the acquisition of Hally Pacific Private Limited on February 23, 2026.",
